          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " manifest plus four sections, prompt, context, tools, and state, mirroring the request the model receives. ①, ②, and ③ mark the request section each part feeds. Each section is a single file or a folder with an entry point, and when both exist the file wins. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "D98 in "
