      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The default renderer outputs XML-tagged Markdown: readable prose with clear parseable boundaries. Renderers own output formatting, indentation, blank lines, bullet markers, numbering, fences, XML spacing, so the structure and its rendered representation stay separate, and other renderers can target other formats from the same tree."
